{
	"description": "The Status switch (SPEC \u00a75.5): every row of the decision table as { status, record, target, keep } -> { status result, record result, outcome code }. record: 'none', {status} (the product's own record), 'foreign' (a record naming another product) or 'unreadable'. schedule: for a scheduled product or saved status, whether its date is 'ahead' (a minute or more) or 'passed'. record_result: 'none', 'clear' (the record is removed) or {save: status} (a new record saving that status). Both StatusSwitchTest (PHPUnit) and status-switch.test.js (Jest) run it, so the grid's mirror cannot drift from the server.",
